b1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘲钦师","author":"吴芾","text":"师与予心总爱山，从来已许伴予閒。\n若为一出俄经月，却恋尘凡未肯还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43597,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"滕王阁","author":"吴芾","text":"尽道滕王阁太卑，合新旧观复雄规。\n我来兴葺非难事，却恐俱为识者嗤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43598,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题心远轩二首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"扁榜当年我命名，喜君心与迹双清。\n眼前风物浑如旧，但觉庭前春草生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43599,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题心远轩二首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"山居我欲避嚣尘，尚觉门庭俗客频。\n羡尔结茅当道左，一轩风月作閒人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43600,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]